":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-09-15T18:28:42Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T20:38:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-16T14:54:35Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110535","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110535","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110535.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110535.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-16T14:54:35Z"},"body":"Updated `Array::resize()` to call `ptrw()` once before looping to initialize typed array elements, instead of accessing each through `.write[]`.\r\n\r\nThis makes `Array.resize()` in gdscript around 2-4x faster for typed arrays, will vary depending on type and size.  Compared with gdscript below:\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _ready() -> void:\r\n\trun_test(\"resize_int\")\r\n\trun_test(\"resize_str\")\r\n\r\nfunc resize_int():\r\n\tvar a: Array[int] = []\r\n\tfor i in 10000:\r\n\t\ta.resize(i)\r\n\t\ta.resize(0)\r\n\t\t\r\nfunc resize_str():\r\n\tvar a: Array[String] = []\r\n\tfor i in 10000:\r\n\t\ta.resize(i)\r\n\t\ta.resize(0)\r\n\r\nfunc run_test(test_name: String):\r\n\tvar start := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tcall(test_name)\r\n\tvar end := Time.get_ticks_msec()\r\n\tprint(\"%s: %dms\" % [test_name, end - start])\r\n```\r\n\r\nold:\r\n```\r\nresize_int: 319ms\r\nresize_str: 415ms\r\n```\r\n\r\nnew:\r\n```\r\nresize_int: 72ms\r\nresize_str: 163ms\r\n```\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110535/reactions","total_count":25,"+1":11,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":14,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110535/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}